# Torpor Orb judges an entering permanent as it exists on the battlefield, copy effects applied (CR 603.6a, 707.2; the
# rulings: "Look at the permanent as it exists on the battlefield, taking into account continuous effects"). Phyrexian
# Metamorph is an artifact creature card, but it enters as a copy of Cryogen Relic, a noncreature artifact, so its copied
# "When this artifact enters ..., draw a card" triggers under Bot2's Orb. Hand: 7 - Island, Mox Sapphire, Sol Ring, Relic
# = 3, + 1 for the Relic = 4; turn 3 draws (5), casts the Metamorph (4) and draws for the copy (5).

